  "details": "1. Prepare a variable not typed string.\n2. Drag the variable to make Set_Variable node\n3. Choose `Create New Variable` from drop down menu.\n4. Then it creates new variable typed string. And the node now has input field for string (I didn't check this field works rightly)\n5. Open drop down again and choose previous variable of step 2.\n6. Then the input field remains.\nVersion: VRCSDK-UDON-2020.06.23.13.15_Closed_Community_Test",
